{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44700","headline":"行路难 · 宝月","name":"行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见孤鴈关外发，酸嘶度杨越。\n空城客子心肠断，幽闺思妇气欲绝。\n凝霜夜下拂罗衣，浮云中断开明月。\n夜夜遥遥徒相思，年年望望情不歇。\n取我匣中青铜镜，情人爲我除白发。\n行路难，行路难。\n夜闻南城汉使度，使我流泪忆长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝月","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}